## 2. Owner entity/model & address storage

`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/model/Owner.java`. `address` is a JPA column with a bean-validation `@NotEmpty`:

```java
@Column(name = "address")
@NotEmpty
