public void setAddress(String address) { this.address = address; }
```

Also relevant on the entity: `city` (`@NotEmpty`), `telephone` (`@NotEmpty` + E.164 `@Pattern`), `email` (`@Email`), `registrationDate`, `customerCode`, and `householdId`:

```java
@Column(name = "household_id")
private String householdId;
...
public String getHouseholdId() { return this.householdId; }
public void setHouseholdId(String householdId) { this.householdId = householdId; }
