DTOs are **generated from OpenAPI** (no hand-written `OwnerFieldsDto.java`/`OwnerDto.java` in the tree; generated into the build output package `org.springframework.samples.petclinic.rest.dto`). Schemas in `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/resources/openapi.yml`:

- **`OwnerFields`** (request body / write model, lines ~1991–2062): `firstName`, `lastName`, `address` (minLength 1, maxLength 255), `city`, `telephone`, `email`, `registrationDate`, and `sharesHousehold` (boolean, `writeOnly: true`, "Not persisted or returned"). `required: [firstName, lastName, address, city, telephone]`.
